     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Dear Colleagues:</font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"> </font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">我遇到一個</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">SQL Datamining Addin </font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">的問題，請幫忙。在我的</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">WIN 10 </font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">更新後，</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Excel</font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">的</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">DM</font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">增益集功能帶（</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Ribbon</font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">）就掛不上去，錯誤訊息如下圖</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">1</font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">和圖</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">2</font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">。請高手指教如何解決此問題。之前</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Excel</font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">的</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">DM</font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">增益集功能帶（</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Ribbon</font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">）是</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">OK</font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">的。RExcel的<span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">增益集卻不受影響，正常。</font></span></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px\"><span style=\"margin:0px;font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">我的系統是</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin:0px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">Win 10 x64</font></span><span style=\"margin:0px;font-